{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Multiplication Property of Equality.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Multiplication Property of Equality.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"multiplication property of equality multiplication property of equality","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Multiplication Property of Equality.md","fileName":"Multiplication Property of Equality.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Multiplication Property of Equality","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:41\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Linear Equations and Modeling]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Linear Equations and Modeling","Equivalent Equations","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Multiplication Property of Equality.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Multiplication Property of Equality.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"multiplication property of equality multiplication property of equality","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Multiplication Property of Equality.md","fileName":"Multiplication Property of Equality.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Multiplication Property of Equality","heading":"Multiplication Property of Equality","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The multiplication property of equality states that multiplying equal quantities by the same number preserves equality. If (a=b), then\n\n$$ac=bc.$$\n\nDivision by the same nonzero number is the inverse use of this property. The nonzero restriction is essential when reversing the transformation, because multiplication by zero collapses every value to the same equation. The property isolates coefficients, clears denominators, and creates [[Equivalent Equations]] during solving.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Linear Equations and Modeling","Equivalent Equations","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Multiplication Property of Equality.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Multiplication Property of Equality.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"multiplication property of equality multiplication property of equality","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Multiplication Property of Equality.md","fileName":"Multiplication Property of Equality.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Multiplication Property of Equality","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[algebraessentials.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Linear Equations and Modeling","Equivalent Equations","algebraessentials.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}